stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Created
    Created --> Discovering: trial admitted
    Discovering --> Modelled: sufficient model learned
    Discovering --> Unknown: no applicable action / insufficient evidence
    Discovering --> Blocked: dependency or authority refusal

    Modelled --> Planned: valid plan found
    Modelled --> Unknown: search budget exhausted
    Modelled --> Refused: model/projection refused

    Planned --> Committed: governed candidate admitted
    Planned --> Refused: governance rejects candidate

    Committed --> Executing
    Executing --> ConsequenceObserved: real actuation succeeds
    Executing --> Blocked: materialization/authority/dependency refusal
    Executing --> Failed: provider execution failure

    ConsequenceObserved --> Verifying
    Verifying --> Level4Alive: SHACL + identity + replay + postcondition pass
    Verifying --> Failed: falsifier / identity / replay / postcondition failure

    Unknown --> [*]
    Refused --> [*]
    Blocked --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    Level4Alive --> [*]
